---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="关于我们"
  description="速修派致力于打造专业、透明、便捷的线上电器维修预约平台，让每一个家庭都能享受到放心的维修服务。"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>关于我们</h1>
      <p>让维修变得简单、透明、放心</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-story">
      <div class="about-text reveal-left">
        <span class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:12px;">我们的故事</span>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:left;margin-bottom:20px;">
          用互联网重新定义家电维修
        </h2>
        <p>
          速修派成立于 2024
          年，致力于通过互联网技术解决传统家电维修行业中的信息不对称、价格不透明、服务质量参差不齐等痛点。
        </p>
        <p>
          我们搭建了一个连接用户与专业维修师傅的线上平台——用户通过微信小程序一键预约，系统智能匹配附近经过严格认证的专业师傅，提供透明报价、准时上门、售后保障的一站式维修服务。
        </p>
        <p>
          目前平台已覆盖空调、冰箱、洗衣机、电视、热水器、厨房电器等全品类家电维修，累计服务超过 <strong
            >10,000</strong
          > 个家庭，合作认证师傅超过 <strong>500</strong> 名，用户好评率 <strong>98%</strong>。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!--
        📌 图片占位区
        用途：团队照片或工作场景照片
        建议尺寸：540×400px · JPG/WebP
        风格：团队合影/师傅工作照/办公室环境
      -->
      <div class="about-image reveal-right">
        <div
          class="img-placeholder"
          style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.35/1;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);"
        >
          <span class="ph-icon">📷</span>
          <span>团队照片 / 工作场景</span>
          <span class="ph-size">建议 540×400px · JPG/WebP</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission / Vision / Values -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--color-bg-alt);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-label">使命与愿景</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">我们的承诺</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">不只是修好电器，更是守护每一个家庭的安心</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-values-grid reveal-stagger">
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap">
            <svg
              width="32"
              height="32"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"
              ></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>使命</h3>
          <p>让每一个家庭都能享受到便捷、专业、放心的家电维修服务。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap">
            <svg
              width="32"
              height="32"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path d="M2 12s3-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3 7-10 7-10-7-10-7z"></path><circle
                cx="12"
                cy="12"
                r="3"></circle></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>愿景</h3>
          <p>成为国内最受信赖的线上家电维修服务品牌。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon-wrap">
            <svg
              width="32"
              height="32"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              ><path
                d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3>价值观</h3>
          <p>透明定价、品质第一、用户至上、持续创新。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Platform Stats -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-label">平台数据</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">用数字说话</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">见证我们的成长与用户的信任</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-row reveal-stagger">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">👥</div>
          <strong>10,000<span style="font-size:1.2rem;">+</span></strong>
          <span>服务用户</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">🔧</div>
          <strong>500<span style="font-size:1.2rem;">+</span></strong>
          <span>认证师傅</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">⭐</div>
          <strong>98<span style="font-size:1.2rem;">%</span></strong>
          <span>好评率</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-icon">📦</div>
          <strong>8<span style="font-size:1.2rem;">+</span></strong>
          <span>服务品类</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ===== Story Grid ===== */
  .about-story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .about-text p strong {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ===== Values Grid ===== */
  .about-values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .value-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 36px 28px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
    transition:
      transform 0.35s var(--ease-out-expo),
      box-shadow 0.35s;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .value-icon-wrap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .value-card:nth-child(1) .value-icon-wrap {
    color: #2563eb;
    background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
  }
  .value-card:nth-child(2) .value-icon-wrap {
    color: #2563eb;
    background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08);
  }
  .value-card:nth-child(3) .value-icon-wrap {
    color: #f59e0b;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
  }

  .value-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .value-card p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* ===== Stats Row ===== */
  .stats-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 40px 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
    transition:
      transform 0.35s var(--ease-out-expo),
      box-shadow 0.35s;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .stat-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: block;
  }

  .stat-card strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    background: var(--gradient-brand);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .stat-card span {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* ===== Responsive ===== */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-story {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .about-image {
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .about-values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .stats-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
